<title>JAPAN: Foreigners net buyers of Japanese stocks in week.</title>
<headline>Foreigners net buyers of Japanese stocks in week.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1997-02-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>Foreigners were net buyers of Japanese stocks on the Tokyo, Osaka and Nagoya stock exchanges in the week of February 3 to February 7, exchange data showed on Friday.</p>
<p>Foreign investors became net buyers after having been net sellers for the past three weeks.</p>
<p>The figures, which are rounded, are as follows:</p>
<p>    Total foreign buying	   528.29 billion yen</p>
<p>    Total foreign selling	  496.89 billion yen</p>
<p>    Net buying			  31.40 billion yen</p>
<p>    Previous week net selling     29.42 billion yen</p>
</text>
